    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p><em>Since ancient times, people have looked to the sky to pray.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Domain:&nbsp;</strong>Gain a spell from a different class at your level or lower as a bonus spell. The spell must deal lightning or thunder damage, or have air, wind or storm in the name. You can replace the ability score used for attack and damage with Wisdom.</p>\n<p>Whenever a spell deals holy damage, you can change that damage to lightning damage</p>\n<p><strong>Domain Spells</strong>: Thundering Blow, Air Bubble, Storm Cloud</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>"
    },
